# Native model/browser research scratch. Preserve gate evidence outside the
# checkout; never let a broad `git add` publish downloaded records or Chromium
# diagnostics as source.
.tmp-editorial-*/
debug.log

# Transient capture and build output. An audit found 150 screenshots (11 MB)
# and 25 browser captures plus five duplicate source archives (3.9 MB) tracked
# here (ENG-010). Clones pay for those forever, and a committed source archive
# can be mistaken for canonical code.
#
# docs/images/ stays tracked on purpose: curated manual screenshots that
# the documentation links to. That is the deliberate exception.
screenshots/
artifacts/browsed_files/
artifacts/imagine_images/
artifacts/*.zip
artifacts/*.tar.gz
artifacts/*.bin
artifacts/*.html
artifacts/RENAME-TO-ZIP.txt

# Audit evidence: the written reports are the deliverable and stay tracked;
# the screenshots and capture data behind them are reproducible output.
# Per-prefix rules (artifacts/audit-*/...) rotted -- gate-* and gauntlet-*
# evidence slipped past them (ENG-010). This is prefix-proof: ignore every
# file under artifacts/, then re-include only the Markdown reports.
artifacts/**
!artifacts/**/
!artifacts/**/*.md
